<tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 9.0pt .75pt 3.75pt 35.25pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;"> Welcome to Intel Retail Partner Solutions Hub! </span></b></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">The Retail Hub is one of the first steps we are taking to provide you with a greater customer experience when interacting with our tools, enabling you to work with us in a simpler and more efficient way. The Retail Hub provides you with access to your work in one location, through Single Sign-On.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 30.0pt .75pt 27.75pt;">
<div align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center; line-height: 15.0pt;"><hr width="100%" size="1" align="center" style="color: #e5e5e5;" noshade="noshade"></div>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45.0pt .75pt 33.0pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">Action Required </span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">We have added a profile for you as a result of your interest in Retail Marketing Funds.<br></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">An account has been generated that will allow you to access Intel’s <a href="https://cqpreview.intel.com/content/www/us/en/secure/retail/partner-solutions/overview.html">Retail Partner Solutions Hub</a>. Please follow the instructions below to get started. <br> <br> Please retain this e-mail for future reference. </span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45.0pt .75pt 33.0pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"></b><b>E-mail Address:</b> {!Contact.Email} </span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt .75pt .75pt 33.0pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;"></span></b><b>What you need to do </b></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45.0pt .75pt 33.0pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">Please verify your e-mail address by clicking this <a href="https://partnercenter.intel.com/login?so=00Do0000000aRcf">link</a> or by copying the URL into your browser. </span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45.0pt .75pt 33.0pt;"></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45.0pt .75pt 33.0pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">If you have any questions, please contact us </span><u><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #0070c0;"> <a href="http://www.intel.com/p/en_US/support">here</a></span></u>.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45.0pt .75pt 33.0pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">Visit this </span> <u><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #0070c0;"><a href="https://tstcqcontent-ssl.cps.intel.com/content/www/us/en/secure/profile/myprofile.html"> link</a></span></u><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;"> any time to manage your profile.</span></p>
